# Doorkeeper Thrull: "Artifacts and creatures entering don't cause abilities to trigger" (CR 603.2, 603.6a). The same
# game as Torpor Orb's with Tezzeret, Cruel Captain, with Bot2's Thrull in its place: Mox Sapphire, cast before the Thrull,
# puts a loyalty counter on Tezzeret (4 -> 5), and then neither Ornithopter, nor Mind Stone, nor the Clue does, every one
# of them an artifact. A Forest is neither an artifact nor a creature, so Tireless Tracker's landfall still triggers and
# makes the Clue (the rulings: "If a nonartifact, noncreature land enters ... the ability will trigger").

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sol Ring
Tezzeret, Cruel Captain
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Tireless Tracker
Mind Stone
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Doorkeeper Thrull
Plains x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Counters.Loyalty = 5
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Doorkeeper Thrull.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tireless Tracker.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Mox Emerald; Sol Ring; Tezzeret, Cruel Captain; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Mind Stone; Tireless Tracker; Clue Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Tezzeret, Cruel Captain.Counters.Loyalty = 5
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Doorkeeper Thrull
